  "content": "<p>Energy Fuels Inc. is a leading United States-based critical minerals company focused on the production of uranium, vanadium, and rare earth elements. The company operates the White Mesa Mill in Utah, which is the only conventional uranium mill currently operating in the U.S. and serves as a strategic hub for processing various critical minerals. Energy Fuels is a major producer of uranium for the nuclear energy industry and is expanding its capabilities into high-purity rare earth element production and heavy mineral sands, positioning itself as a key player in the domestic supply chain for clean energy and advanced technologies.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Chalmers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Chalmers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Chalmers has served as the President and Chief Executive Officer of Energy Fuels since February 1, 2018. Prior to that, he served as the Chief Operating Officer of the Company from July 1, 2016 to January 31, 2018. He has over 40 years of experience in the mining industry, specifically in uranium and base metals.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tom%20Boron\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tom Boron</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Boron has served as the Chief Financial Officer of Energy Fuels since May 2023. He has over 30 years of financial and accounting experience in the mining and natural resources sectors.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Frydenlund\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Frydenlund</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President, Chief Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Frydenlund has served as the Executive Vice President, Chief Legal Officer and Corporate Secretary of Energy Fuels since 2012. He has been with the Company and its predecessors since 1997.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Curtis%20Moore\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Curtis Moore</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Senior Vice President of Marketing and Corporate Development</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Moore has served as the Senior Vice President of Marketing and Corporate Development since 2012. He is responsible for uranium and vanadium sales and marketing.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alex%20Morrison\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alex Morrison</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Morrison is a CPA with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ben%20Fine\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ben Fine</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Fine has extensive experience in the uranium industry and corporate finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Glasier\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Glasier</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, CEO & Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Glasier is the founder of the Company and has over 40 years of experience in the uranium industry. He was the founder of Energy Fuels Inc. and served as its President and CEO. He has extensive experience in uranium exploration, development, and marketing.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ivy%20Estabrooke\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ivy Estabrooke</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Estabrooke has a background in science and technology policy and innovation.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Birks%20Bovaird\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Birks Bovaird</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Bovaird is the Chairman of the Board. He has been a director of the Company since 2006. He has extensive experience in corporate finance and the resource industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Chalmers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Chalmers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and CEO of Energy Fuels Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Barbara%20Filas\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Barbara Filas</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Filas is a mining engineer with over 40 years of experience in the mining industry, including executive leadership and technical roles.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ben%20Fine\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ben Fine</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Fine has extensive experience in the uranium industry and corporate finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Kirkwood\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Kirkwood</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kirkwood has over 35 years of experience in the mining and energy industries.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alex%20Morrison\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alex Morrison</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Morrison is a CPA with over 30 years of experience in the mining industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ivy%20Estabrooke\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ivy Estabrooke</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Estabrooke has a background in science and technology policy and innovation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/George%20Glasier\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">George Glasier</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, CEO & Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Glasier is the founder of the Company and has over 40 years of experience in the uranium industry. He was the founder of Energy Fuels Inc. and served as its President and CEO. He has extensive experience in uranium exploration, development, and marketing.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1385849/000138584924000014/uuuu-20231231.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Energy Fuels Inc. Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-02-23)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.energyfuels.com/about-us/management-team/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Energy Fuels Official Website - Management Team</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.energyfuels.com/about-us/board-of-directors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Energy Fuels Official Website - Board of Directors</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li></ul>"
